    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Story\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 30XX, the Space Rabbit lived peacefully on the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, while traveling between planets aboard a spaceship, it collided with a meteor and crash-landed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crash site was \u201cOld Earth,\u201d a planet once inhabited by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to gravitational anomalies, everything in this strange world may float\u2014or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapting to this bizarre environment were the creatures known as \u201cOld Rabbits.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the Space Rabbit overcome this strange planet and safely return to the Moon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Climbing Action\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spaceship that will return you to the Moon lies at the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll find various carrots scattered about\u2014these serve as fuel for the spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more carrots you collect, the greater your chance of returning home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey back, you will face three meteor showers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive all three, you can safely return to the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some \u201cOld Rabbits\u201d will teach you how to jump in exchange for one Golden Carrot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more jumps you can perform, the easier your journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010RTA\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game may shatter the conventions of Real-Time Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, effort is key\u2014but sometimes, all you need is luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your completion time is recorded under various challenge conditions, such as \u201cNo Jump Unlocked\u201d or \u201cUsing Specific Shortcuts.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge in your own style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Extras\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special costumes for the Space Rabbit are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They unlock when certain conditions are met\u2014aim to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Luck!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Story\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 30XX, the Space Rabbit lived peacefully on the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, while traveling between planets aboard a spaceship, it collided with a meteor and crash-landed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crash site was \u201cOld Earth,\u201d a planet once inhabited by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to gravitational anomalies, everything in this strange world may float\u2014or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapting to this bizarre environment were the creatures known as \u201cOld Rabbits.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the Space Rabbit overcome this strange planet and safely return to the Moon?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Climbing Action\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spaceship that will return you to the Moon lies at the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll find various carrots scattered about\u2014these serve as fuel for the spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more carrots you collect, the greater your chance of returning home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey back, you will face three meteor showers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you survive all three, you can safely return to the Moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Features\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some \u201cOld Rabbits\u201d will teach you how to jump in exchange for one Golden Carrot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more jumps you can perform, the easier your journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010RTA\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game may shatter the conventions of Real-Time Attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, effort is key\u2014but sometimes, all you need is luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your completion time is recorded under various challenge conditions, such as \u201cNo Jump Unlocked\u201d or \u201cUsing Specific Shortcuts.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the challenge in your own style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Extras\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special costumes for the Space Rabbit are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They unlock when certain conditions are met\u2014aim to collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Luck!</p>",
    "short_description": "A high-stakes challenge action game where a space rabbit sets out for the moon!Can you overcome countless trials and safely return to the moon? Only the gods know!",
